	<</if>>

	<<starfishicon>><<link [[떠난다|Starfish Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

:: Pound Free
<<effects>>
<<wearProp "key">>
<<endevent>>
<<loadNPC 0 "black_dog">>
열쇠는 늘 있던 자리에 있다. 우리를 열고, 안에 있는 <<beasttype>>【을를】 위해 활짝 열어주는 것을 막을 것은 아무것도 없다. 어둠 속에서 <<bHis>> 노란 눈이 나타난다. <<bHe 0>>【은는】 잠시 당신을 바라보다가, 빛 속으로 걸어 나온다.
<br><br>

<<bHe>> stops near the doorway, then looks past you towards the exit.
<br><br>

<<link [[안심시킨다|Pound Free Reassure]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[밖으로 이끈다|Pound Free Lead]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Pound Free Reassure
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"I-I'm here to rescue you," you say. "Please don't be frightened."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"I-I'm here to help," you say, stopping just outside <<bhis>> reach. "Can you come with me?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I'm here to get you out," you say. "Please come with me, and stay close."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I'm here to help," you say. "I'll go slowly. Just come with me."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I'm getting you out," you say. "Stay close."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I'm getting you out of here," you say. "Come on, before someone notices."
<<else>>
	"I'm freeing you," you say. "Come on. We need to hurry."
<</if>>
<br><br>

You step back from the cage door and give the <<beasttype 0>> room to move.
<<if $monster is 1>>
	"따라가겠다." <<bhe>>【이가】 말한다. "그리고 숲으로 달아날 거다. 다시는 여기로 돌아오지 않아."
<<else>>
	<<bHe>> gets to <<bhis>> feet, stretches, then moves to your side.
<</if>>
<<bhim>>에게서 새로운 기운이 느껴진다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Pound Free Lead]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Pound Free Lead
<<effects>>
<<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>><<generate5>><<generate6>><<person2>>
당신은 <<beasttype 0>>【을를】 옆에 세우고 출구로 향한다. <span class="red">붉은 등이 깜빡이며 켜지고, 경보가 울려 퍼진다.</span> 방 끝, 출구 맞은편의 금속 문이 덜컹거리며 열린다. <<person>>【이가】 <<his>> 손에 전화기를 든 채, <<his>> 셔츠에 묻은 갓 생긴 커피 얼룩과 함께 달려 나온다.
<br><br>

"경찰이죠? 침입입니다. 네, 보여요. 알겠습니다." <<He>>【은는】 전화기를 바닥에 떨어뜨린다. "거기 꼼짝 마!" <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "경찰이 곧 도착할 거야. 이걸로 끝내는 게—"
<br><br>

The <<beasttype 0>> turns towards <<him>>. The <<person>> stops talking, takes one step back, then hurries through the metal door so quickly <<he>> nearly falls. It shuts behind <<him>>.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Pound Free 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Pound Free 2
<<effects>><<wearProp "key">>

경보에 잠이 깬 다른 <<pound_text>>【이가】 당신이 지나가는 것을 지켜본다. 현관문은 원격으로 잠겼고, 당신은 맞는 열쇠를 찾느라 귀중한 시간을 허비한다.
<br><br>

당신은 바깥뜰로 나와 문 너머의 어두운 길로 달려간다. <span class="red">앞과 양옆에서 눈부신 불빛이 비친다.</span> "경찰이다." 한 목소리가 우렁차게 울린다. "꼼짝 마라, 포위됐다."
<br><br>

<<beasttype 0>>【이가】 으르렁거린다.
<br><br>

<<link [[검은 개가 탈출할 수 있도록 시선을 끈다|Pound Free Distract]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[달린다|Pound Free Run]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Pound Free Distract
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"P-Please run," you whisper, patting the <<beasttype 0>>'s side. "I'll be okay."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Go," you whisper, patting the <<beasttype 0>>'s side. "I'll be all right."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Please go," you whisper. "Don't wait for me."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Run," you whisper. "I've got this."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Run," you whisper. "I'll keep them busy."
<<else>>
	"Run," you whisper. "I'll be safe."
<</if>>
You give <<bhim 0>> a gentle push towards the exit. There is no time to check whether <<bhe 0>> understood.
<br><br>

You turn towards the flashing lights, fill your lungs, then charge with a roar.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Pound Free 3]]>><</link>>
<br>

