:: Pound Work Sweep
<<effects>>
<<if $slimePoundTask>>당신은 특정 작업을 수행하라는 <<= numberOfEarSlime() gte 2 ? "슬라임들의" : "슬라임의">> 명령을 따른다.<<unset $slimePoundTask>><</if>>
당신은 빗자루를 들고
<<switch random(1,2)>>
	<<case 1>>우리에서 털을 쓸어낸다. 깔끔하게 더미가 쌓이자, 쓰레받기에 쓸어 담는다.
	<<case 2>>우리를 청소하기 시작한다. 털 뭉치를 깔끔하게 쓸어 모은 뒤 쓰레받기에 밀어 넣는다.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<generateBeastVictim 1 dog>>
<<if random(1, 3) is 3>>
	<<beasttype>>【이가】 이빨로 빗자루를 물어채는 바람에 빗자루가 걸린다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[꾸짖는다|Pound Work Sweep Scold]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 200>>
	<br>
	<<link [[씨름한다|Pound Work Sweep Wrestle]]>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 1 6000>>
	<br>
<<elseif random(1, 2) is 2>>
	우리 한구석을 청소하고 있을 때, <<beasttype>>【이가】 쓰레받기 쪽으로 다가온다. <<bHe>>【은는】 냄새를 맡더니 앞발로 손잡이를 건드린다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[계속 청소한다|Pound Work Sweep Mess]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[야단친다|Pound Work Sweep Stop]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 200>>
	<br>

<<else>>
	<<endevent>><<generate1>><<person1>>
	당신이 지나갈 때 한 <<person>>【이가】 손잡이를 붙잡아 멈춰 세운다. <<He>>【은는】 다가와 당신의 <<bottom>>에 손을 얹는다.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	"제대로 쓰는 법을 보여줄게." <<he>>【이가】 더 가까이 다가오며 말한다.
	<<if $NPCList[0].penissize gte 3>>
		<<his>> <<print window.KR.getPenisDescKr($NPCList[0].penisdesc)>>【이가】 당신에게 눌리는 것이 느껴진다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $anxiety gte 2>>
		<span class="red">공황이 덮쳐오고,</span> 당신은 <<person>>【을를】 마구 공격한다. <<he>>【이가】 손을 놓자 고통스러운 비명과 함께 붉은빛이 스쳐 지나간다. 당신은 마당의 외딴곳으로 도망친다. 숨이 진정될 때까지 기다린다. <<him>>【을를】 심하게 다치게 한 것 같지는 않다.<<severe_anxiety_disorder_text>><<crime "assault">><<crimeUp 10 "assault">>
		<br><br>

		<<poundEndEvent true>>
	<<elseif $anxiety gte 1>>
		<span class="red">공황이 덮쳐오고,</span> 당신은 공포에 얼어붙는다. <<person>>【은는】 그것을 동의로 받아들인다.<<anxiety_disorder_text>><<trauma 6>><<gtrauma>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Pound Work Sweep Go]]>><</link>><<if $tending lt 200>><<gtending>><</if>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[순순히 따른다|Pound Work Sweep Go]]>><<trauma 6>><</link>><<if $tending lt 200>><<gtending>><</if>>
		<br>
		<<link [[밀친다|Pound Work Sweep Shove]]>><<pound_status 1>><<stress 6>><</link>><<gstress>><<gpound_status>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<wearProp "broom">>

:: Pound Work Sweep Go
<<effects>>

<<person>>【은는】 당신의 팔을 잡고 <<his>> 빗자루질 기술을 시연하면서 <<his>> 몸을 지독하게 가까이 밀착시킨다. <<He>>【은는】 또한 <<pound_text>>에 대해, 그리고 그들을 안심시키는 방법에 대해서도 이야기한다.

<<if $tending lt 200>>
	<<his>> 소름 끼치는 행동에도 불구하고 한두 가지를 배운다. "고마워할 필요 없어." <<he>>【이가】 말하며, 떠나기 전 당신의 <<bottom>>【을를】 한 대 친다.<<tending 2>>
<<else>>
	<<He>>【은는】 자신만만해 보이지만, 당신이 이미 아는 것 외에는 아무것도 가르쳐주지 않는다. "고마워할 필요 없어." <<he>>【이가】 말하며, 떠나기 전 당신의 <<bottom>>【을를】 한 대 친다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Sweep Shove
<<effects>>

You plant both hands against the <<persons>> chest and shove. <<He>> stumbles back a step, glares at you, then looks towards the supervisor. After a pause, <<he>> backs off instead of coming at you again.
<br><br>

A few of the <<pound_text>> have stopped what they're doing to watch. When nothing else happens, they turn away.
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Sweep Scold
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if $tendingSuccess>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"P-Please let go," you say, keeping both hands on the broom.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"L-Let go, please," you say, pulling the broom towards you.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Let go, please," you say. "I need the broom."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please let go," you say. "You can chew something else."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Drop it," you say, giving the broom a short tug.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Oi. Drop it," you say.
	<<else>>
		"Let go," you say.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	The <<beasttype>> keeps <<bhis>> teeth on the broom for another second, then lets go. <span class="green">You pull it free before <<bhe>> changes <<bhis>> mind.</span> <<bHe>> turns to chew on one of the bars instead.<<gpound_status>><<pound_status 1>>
<<else>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"P-Please let go," you say, tugging carefully at the broom.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"L-Let go," you say, but the next hard pull nearly takes the broom from your hands.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Let go, please," you say, trying to pull the broom back.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please," you say. "I need that back."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Drop it," you say, planting your feet and pulling.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Give it back," you snap, pulling hard.
	<<else>>
		"Let go," you say, pulling the broom towards you.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<span class="red">The <<beasttype>> jerks <<bhis>> head from side to side until your grip slips.</span> <<bHe>> chews the broom until <<bhe>> gets bored, then drops it with teeth marks along the wood.<<lpound_status>><<pound_status -1>><<if $tending lt 200>><<tending 1>><<gtending>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Sweep Wrestle
<<effects>>

<<if $physiqueSuccess>>
	당신은 창살에 발을 디뎌 지지하고, <span class="green">빗자루 손잡이를 <<beasttype>>의 입에서 빼내면서</span> 자루를 비튼다. <<bHe>>【은는】 낙담하여 눕는다.<<gpound_status>><<pound_status 1>>
<<else>>
	당신은 창살에 발을 디뎌 지지하지만, <span class="red"><<beasttype>>【이가】 당신을 끌어당겨 균형을 잃게 하고,</span> 어깨를 금속에 부딪히게 한다. <<bHe>>【은는】 만족하고 나서야 손아귀에서 힘을 풀고, 나무에 이빨 자국을 남긴다.<<gpain>><<pain 4>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Sweep Mess
<<effects>>

<<beasttype>>【이가】 쓰레받기를 넘어뜨려, 담겨 있던 것들을 다시 바닥에 쏟아버린다. 당신이 <<bhim>>【을를】 말릴 새도 없이, <<bHe>>【은는】 털 뭉치를 가지고 놀기 시작하며 사방에 쓰레기를 흩뿌린다.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>
<<beasttype>>【은는】 결국 지쳐서 가버리고, 거대한 난장판만 남는다. 당신은 최선을 다해 청소하려 노력하지만, 두 번 청소하는 데는 꽤나 힘이 든다.<<tiredness 6>><<gtiredness>>
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Sweep Stop
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if $tendingSuccess>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"Please leave that alone," you say, stepping between the <<beasttype>> and the dustpan.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"P-Please don't," you say, moving in front of the dustpan.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Leave that alone, please," you say, blocking <<bhis>> path.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please don't make another mess," you say, reaching for the dustpan.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Leave it," you say, stepping in front of <<bhim>>.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Hey. Leave it alone," you say.
	<<else>>
		"Don't touch that," you say, stepping between <<bhim>> and the dustpan.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $monster is 1>>
		The <<beasttype>> lowers <<bhis>> head and walks away. "Mean human..." <<bhe>> says. "Just playing..."
	<<else>>
		The <<beasttype>> lowers <<bhis>> head and walks away with a quiet whine.
	<</if>>
	<<pound_status 1>><<gpound_status>>
	<br><br>

	You pick up the dustpan before another <<beasttype>> gets interested, then finish cleaning the cage.
	<br><br>

<<else>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"P-Please stop," you say, hurrying towards the dustpan.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"D-Don't," you say, reaching for it.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Leave that alone, please," you say, moving towards <<bhim>>.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please don't," you say. "I just cleaned that."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Leave it," you say, reaching for the dustpan.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Oi, knock it off," you say.
	<<else>>
		"Don't do that," you say, reaching for the dustpan.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	The <<beasttype>> ignores you and knocks the dustpan over before you can grab it. Fur and dirt scatter across the floor, and <<bhe>> bats the mess around while you try to stop <<bhim>>.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	By the time <<bhe>> loses interest, you have almost as much to clean as before. You gather everything up again, taking care to keep the dustpan out of reach.<<tiredness 6>><<gtiredness>><<pound_status -1>><<lpound_status>>
	<br><br>

<</if>>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Feed
<<effects>><<wearProp "dog bowl">>
<<if $slimePoundTask>>당신은 <<= numberOfEarSlime() gte 2 ? "슬라임들의" : "슬라임의">> 명령에 따라 특정 임무를 수행한다.<<unset $slimePoundTask>><</if>>
당신은 뒤뜰의 그릇들을 채우고, 그 후 굶주린 <<pound_text>> 무리가 우리에서 풀려난다.
<br><br>

<<if random(1, 2) is 2>>
	그들은 당신과 다른 직원들을 무시하고 그릇으로 몰려든다.
	<<generateBeastVictim 2 dog>>
	수척한 <<beasttype 0>>【이가】 <<bhis 0>> 길을 뚫고 나아가려 하지만 너무 약하다. 다른 <<beasttype 1>>【이가】 <<bhim 0>>【을를】 밀쳐낸다. <<bHe 0>>【은는】 패배하여 눕는다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다른 녀석들이 공평하게 행동하게 만든다|Pound Work Feed Soothe]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 400>>
	<br>
	<<link [[위로한다|Pound Work Feed Comfort]]>><<stress 6>><<trauma -6>><</link>><<gstress>><<ltrauma>>
	<br>
	<<link [[아무것도 하지 않는다|Pound Work Feed Nothing]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	그들은 순식간에 음식을 먹어치우고, 이 만찬에 대해 개인적으로 당신에게 감사하는 것 같다.<<gpound_status>><<pound_status 1>>
	<br><br>

	<<poundEndEvent>>
<</if>>

:: Pound Work Feed Soothe
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if $tendingSuccess>>
	You crouch beside the <<beasttype 1>> and scratch gently behind <<bhis 1>> ear.
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"Will you let your friend have some?" you ask. "There's enough."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"C-Could you move over a little?" you ask. "Your friend needs to eat too."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Let your friend eat too, please," you say. "There's enough for both of you."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please share," you say, keeping your hand against <<bhis 1>> fur. "Just make a little room."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Move over," you say. "Let <<bhim 0>> eat."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Come on, move over," you say. "You're not eating all of it."
	<<else>>
		"Let your friend have some," you say. "There's enough for both of you."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $monster is 1>>
		<span class="green">The <<beasttype 1>> leans into your hand, then shifts aside.</span> <<bHe 1>> stays beside the bowl while the <<beasttype 0>> eats, keeping the other <<pound_text>> away. When <<bhe 0>> finishes, <<bhe 0>> licks your hand.
	<<else>>
		<span class="green"><<beasttype 1>>【은는】 당신의 손길에 진정되어,</span> <<beasttype 0>>【이가】 <<bhim 1>> 옆에서 먹도록 허락한다. <<bHe 0>>【은는】 <<bhis 0>> 배를 채우고 만족하며 쓰러진다.
	<</if>>
	<<gpound_status>><<pound_status 1>>
<<else>>
	You crouch beside the <<beasttype 1>> and reach towards <<bhis 1>> ear, <span class="red">but <<bhe 1>> snaps at your hand.</span> You pull back before <<bhe 1>> can bite you, while the other staff laugh.<<lpound_status>><<pound_status -1>><<if $tending lt 400>><<tending 1>><<gtending>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Feed Comfort
<<effects>>

You wait beside the <<beasttype 0>> until the others move away from the bowls, then crouch and stroke <<bhis 0>> back. <<bHe 0>> stays close to your leg while the last scraps disappear.
<br><br>

When the other <<pound_text>> are done, <<bhe 0>> steps forward and licks each bowl clean. You keep your hand on <<bhis 0>> back until <<bhes 0>> finished.
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Feed Nothing
<<effects>>

당신은 다른 직원들과 함께 먹이 쟁탈전을 지켜본다. <<beasttype 0>>【은는】 그릇을 깨끗이 핥는다.
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Brush
<<effects>>

<<generateBeastVictim 1 dog>><<wearProp "brush">>
<<if $slimePoundTask>>당신은 <<= numberOfEarSlime() gte 2 ? "슬라임들의" : "슬라임의">> 명령에 따라 특정 임무를 수행한다.<<unset $slimePoundTask>><</if>>
솔을 손에 들고, 당신은 우리 중 하나로 들어간다.
<br><br>

<<cleareventpool>>
<<if beastSexEnabledForType("dog", $monster is 1)>>
	<<addinlineevent "pound_brush_1">>
		안에 있는 <<beasttype>>【은는】 친근하다. 어쩌면 너무 친근할지도 모른다.
		<<if $monster is 1>>
			<<bHe>>【은는】 당신의 허리를 팔로 감싸고, 당신의 허벅지에 몸을 비벼댄다.
		<<else>>
			<<bHe>>【은는】 뒷다리로 일어서서, 당신의 허벅지에 몸을 비벼댄다.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[꾸짖는다|Pound Work Brush Tell]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 600>>
		<br>
		<<if hasSexStat("deviancy", 2)>>
			<<link [[허락한다|Pound Work Brush Allow]]>><</link>><<deviant2>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "pound_brush_2">>
	안에 있는 <<beasttype>>【은는】 낮은 으르렁거림으로 당신을 맞이한다.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[달랜다|Pound Work Brush Soothe]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 600>>
	<br>
	<<link [[더 온순한 동물을 찾아 빗질한다|Pound Work Brush Find]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if beastSexEnabledForType("dog", $monster is 1)>>
		<<link [[개처럼 행동해서 안심시킨다|Pound Work Brush Act]]>><</link>><<deviant1>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "pound_brush_3">>
	<<beasttype>>【은는】 솔을 보고, 그 다음 당신을 본다.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"전에 사람이 와서 빗질해줬다. 지금은 깨끗하다." <<beasttype>>【은는】 당신의 머리카락을 본다. "지저분해 보인다. 내가 대신 빗질해줄까?" <<bHe>>【은는】 솔을 가리킨다.
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>>【은는】 혼란스러운 듯 <<bhis>> 머리를 갸웃거린다. 당신은 <<beasttype>>【을를】 빗질하려 하지만, <<bhe>>【은는】 저항하며 당신의 머리카락을 핥으려 한다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[빗질을 고집한다|Pound Work Brush Clean End]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[대신 몸을 맡긴다|Pound Work Brush Clean]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</addinlineevent>>
<<runeventpool>>

:: Pound Work Brush Tell
<<effects>><<wearProp "brush">>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if $tendingSuccess>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"P-Please stop," you say, putting a hand against the <<beasttype>>'s shoulder. "I need to brush you."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"S-Stop that," you say, trying to push <<bhim>> away from your leg.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"That's enough," you say. "Move aside, please."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please get down," you say. "I'll brush you if you behave."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Off," you say, pushing <<bhim>> back.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Get off me," you say, pushing at <<bhis>> chest.
	<<else>>
		"저리 가." 당신은 말한다. "훠이!"
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Yes!" the <<beasttype>> says, dropping back onto all fours. "Brush me now?"
	<<else>>
		<span class="green">The <<beasttype>> drops back onto all fours and leaves your leg alone.</span>
	<</if>>
	<<gpound_status>><<pound_status 1>>
	<br><br>

	<<bHe>> lies down, and you start brushing. Before long, one of <<bhis>> back legs kicks at the air whenever the brush reaches a good spot.
	<br><br>

	<<poundEndEvent>>
<<else>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"P-Please stop," you say, pushing at <<bhis>> shoulder.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"S-Stop," you say, trying to keep the <<beasttype>> away from your leg.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Stop that, please," you say, pushing at <<bhim>>.
