<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"No. It's my job," you say.
<<else>>
	"아니요." 당신이 말한다. "보호소에서 일해요."
<</if>>
<br><br>

The <<person>> nods, then looks at the leashes in your hands. "I wanted to see the pups once, maybe adopt one, but they stopped me at the gate. I swear I've seen others enter. Maybe they didn't like my face."
<br><br>

Once the <<beastsplural>> have run off most of their energy, you call them back and clip the leashes onto their collars. You lead them back to the pound.
<br><br>

<<pound_walk_end>>

