:: Pound Work Walk Hide
<<effects>>
<<wearProp "dog leash">>
무릎을 꿇고 나무 가장자리 주위를 살핀다. 몸을 낮추고 아무에게도 너무 가까이 다가가지 않으면, 아마 무리 속에서 발각되지 않을 것이다. 하지만 만약 발각된다면 더욱 굴욕적일 것이다.
<br><br>

You take a breath, lower yourself onto your hands and knees, then crawl out with the leashes gathered in one hand.
<<deviancy3>>

You keep your eyes on shop signs, doorways and the legs of people ahead, using them to work out where you are without lifting your head too high. The <<beastsplural>> move around you as you make your way along the street.
<br><br>

You reach the pound without anyone stopping you. The staff laugh and leer when you crawl through the entrance, so you get to your feet, grab a clean towel from a nearby trolley, then cover yourself before returning the <<beastsplural>> to their cages.
<br><br>

<<endcombat>>
You make <<wage $pound.money "tending" "bird" 0.45>>.
